# Project OS architecture (v0.1)

Authoritative doc: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.

- Keep **Domain / Application / Infrastructure**. Domain is pure PHP (no WordPress).
- API-first envelope: `{success,code,message,data,meta}`.
- Admin-only routes with `permission_callback` (`manage_avs_projects`).
- Quote totals always calculated server-side; catalog unit prices are snapshotted onto line items.
- Integer TWD amounts only in this scaffold.
- Versioned migrator on activation; idempotency on monetary writes; multi-table writes in transactions.
- **Out of scope for v0.1:** quotation version snapshots, immutable approval/review FSM, audit logger, PDF, CRM, payments, Notion, portals, UI.
